<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath up 2.53 pct on results.</title>
<headline>Sampath up 2.53 pct on results.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sampath Bank Ltd rose 2.53 percent or two rupees to 81 in early Monday trading as investors reacted to good interim results, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is rising due to the good interim results for the six months to June,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The blue chip Sampath Bank said net profits for the six months to June 30 had risen 21.2 percent to 150.22 million rupees.</p>
<p>It is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
